{"product_id":"the-6-most-important-decisions-youll-ever-make-a-guide-for-teens-updated-for-the-digital-age","title":"The 6 Most Important Decisions You'll Ever Make: A Guide for Teens: Updated for the Digital Age","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the author of the wildly popular bestseller The 7 Habits of Highly Effective Teens comes the go-to guide that helps teens cope with major challenges they face in their lives—now updated for today’s social media age.In this newly revised edition, Sean Covey helps teens figure out how to approach the six major challenges they face: gaining self-esteem, dealing with their parents, making friends, being wise about sex, coping with substances, and succeeding at school and planning a career.Covey understands the pain and confusion that teens and their parents experience in the face of these weighty, life-changing, and common difficulties. He shows readers how to use the 7 Habits to cope with, manage, and ultimately conquer each challenge—and become happier and more productive.Now updated for the digital and social media age, Covey covers how technology affects these six decisions, keeping the information and advice relevant to today’s teenagers.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 156 x 232\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Covey Sean\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781501157134\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748966850713,"sku":"16RC-19781501157134","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d6693b284f4_The_6_Most_Important_Decisions_You_ll_Ever_Make-_A_Guide_for_Teens-_Updated_for_the_Digital_Age_Covey_Sean.jpg?v=1758895791","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-6-most-important-decisions-youll-ever-make-a-guide-for-teens-updated-for-the-digital-age","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}